 "name": "126-column-items",
 "description": "A column item puts the value in the column of a header cell by the tab slots: the same slot n of 1 or more, the same slot count on the two lines and on each line between, no blank line, no other slot of the header with a column word of the field, and no second header between. A field item in slot 0 of the value's line is then a row label. A field with columns needs its column, from a column item or a column word in a passing field item, or the decision gets COLUMN_NOT_AT_VALUE. A field without columns decides as in spec 0.11 (spec 0.12, #540).",
